                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I am not going to say this is a bad Visual Novel, it just wasn't my 'cup of tea'. I was dissapointed but interested in the short route I seemingly completed. I know there are possibly more routes, but the way my route abruptly ended, as well as how I didn't get any credits to indicate i reached an ending and was just randomly greeted with the Title screen again. I feel like the story was progressing very interestingly, but to reach the point I was at, where it seemed the story was just about to really start, it just... ended. I'm sure others will enjoy this more than I did, especially if they dont get the ending I did first but I was left very unsatisfied with the way my route seemingly randomly ended, enough for me to not want to try others sadly. \n\n",
